# DonorLink UG: Phase 4 (Email Notifications and Reminders) Walkthrough

This walkthrough documents the architecture, database schema, calendar generation, automated reminder sweeps, Brevo send budget protections, staff announcement dispatching, and verification procedures for **Phase 4: Email Notifications and Reminders** for **Uganda Blood Transfusion Services (UBTS)**.

---

## 1. System Architecture & Notification Lifecycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor as Voluntary Donor
    actor Staff as UBTS Staff
    participant Web as Application Controller
    participant Svc as MailBudget Service
    participant Q as Database Queue / Scheduler
    participant Log as notification_logs Table
    participant Mail as Brevo SMTP / Log Mailer

    Note over Donor,Mail: 1. Transactional Booking / Reschedule / Cancel Events
    Donor->>Web: Books / Reschedules / Cancels Appointment
    Web->>Log: Insert notification_logs (status='queued', unique dedupe_key)
    Web->>Q: Dispatch queued Notification (tries=3, backoff=[60,300,900])
    Q->>Mail: shouldSend() check -> generates RFC 5545 .ics -> sends mail
    Mail-->>Log: Update status='sent', sent_at=now() (or 'skipped' / 'failed')

    Note over Donor,Mail: 2. Scheduled Reminders Sweep (Every 10 Minutes)
    Q->>Web: php artisan donorlink:send-reminders
    Web->>Log: Query current booked slots in 24h & 2h windows
    Web->>Log: Check 3-hour skip rule (recent confirmation/reschedule)
    alt Within 3h of previous confirmation/reschedule
        Web->>Log: Record status='skipped' ("Confirmation sent < 3h ago")
    else Eligible for Reminder
        Web->>Log: Insert queued row (dedupe_key="reminder_{variant}:appointment:{id}:slot:{slot_id}")
        Web->>Q: Dispatch AppointmentReminder notification
    end

    Note over Staff,Mail: 3. Staff New-Drive Announcements & Batch Dispatching
    Staff->>Web: Opens Published Drive -> Clicks "Send Announcement"
    Web->>Svc: MailBudget::remaining() check
    Web->>Web: Modal confirms eligible opted-in donors & estimated 10m runs
    Staff->>Web: POST /staff/drives/{drive}/announcement
    Web->>Log: Bulk insert queued logs for opted-in donors (dedupe_key="announcement:drive:{id}:user:{uid}")
    
    loop Every 10 Minutes via Scheduler
        Q->>Web: php artisan donorlink:dispatch-announcements
        Web->>Svc: Check remaining budget >= transactional reserve
        alt Budget Available
            Web->>Log: Fetch up to announcement_chunk (default 40) queued logs
            Web->>Mail: Send NewDriveAnnouncement (includes signed unsubscribe link)
            Mail-->>Log: Update status='sent', sent_at=now()
        else Budget Below Reserve
            Web->>Q: Stop and resume on next run
        end
    end
```

