### F. Copy & Consent Updates
- **Registration Consent Checkbox:**
  > *"I agree to DonorLink UG storing my details so UBTS can manage my appointments and email me appointment confirmations, reminders and announcements of new blood drives. I have read the privacy notice."*
- **Privacy Notice:** Explicitly documents appointment emails, 24h & 2h reminders, new-drive announcements, and self-service opt-out.
- **Booking / Reschedule / Cancel Messages:** Inform donors that a confirmation email is on its way to their verified address.
- **Appointments Header:** Notes that reminders are emailed 24 hours and 2 hours before the appointment.
- **Zero Medical Advice:** All copy is strictly restricted to logistics (date, time, venue, arrival ID requirements).

---

### G. Admin Notification Audit Log (`/admin/notifications`)
- Accessible only to administrators (`role:admin` middleware).
- Paginated table showing user, notification type, status badge, sent time in EAT, created time in EAT, and error descriptions.
- Filterable by notification type, status, and creation date.
- **Strictly contains no email bodies, tokens, or links.**

