## 4. Production Launch Checklist (Laravel Cloud)

- [ ] **Sender Domain Records in Brevo:** Configure and verify SPF, DKIM, and DMARC DNS records for `<your-domain.ug>` in Brevo.
- [ ] **Production `APP_URL`:** Configure `APP_URL=https://<your-domain.ug>` in Laravel Cloud environment variables so all generated signed links (unsubscribe, email verification) use valid HTTPS endpoints.
- [ ] **Queue Worker (Laravel Cloud):** Enable the **Queue Worker** toggle in the Laravel Cloud application settings.
- [ ] **Scheduler (Laravel Cloud):** Enable the **Scheduler** toggle in the Laravel Cloud application settings.
- [ ] **Confirm Brevo Allowance:** Confirm verified plan limits on Brevo's account page and configure `DONORLINK_MAIL_DAILY_BUDGET` below the verified limit.
- [ ] **Staging Concurrency Check:** Re-run `php artisan donorlink:booking-race-check --capacity=5 --attempts=20` against the production database engine (MySQL/PostgreSQL) on staging.
